diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 88ae41a154d967432b0105b0feebf60c999a0f92..8c49228787c72b59329089e4e0b68c35803642ca 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -25,6 +25,10 @@ behaviour stays deterministic.
 A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price, in both `quote` and `book`. The reduced
 total is rounded to whole cents, a half cent in favour of the customer.
 
-Cancellation (no refund less than 24 hours before the start, full refund otherwise) is not implemented yet.
+`cancel(bookingId, at)` cancels a booking at the ISO-8601 UTC instant `at` and returns
+`{ bookingId, refund }`, in euro cents. The refund is the booking's total (as paid, discount included) when
+`at` is at least 24 hours before the start, and 0 when it is less than 24 hours before or after the start.
+A cancelled booking no longer holds its equipment, but keeps its id, so later ids stay sequential. It throws
+for an unknown booking, an invalid `at`, or a booking that is already cancelled.
 
 Run the tests with `npm test`.
